From: elsirion <elsirion@protonmail.com>
Date: Wed, 16 Sep 2026 14:08:26 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] feat(sidebar): tint the whole worktree card when it needs
 attention

The status lane's bell and question glyphs are 13px, so a workspace
waiting on the user is easy to miss in a long sidebar. Layer a whole-card
wash over the surface instead: the shared --agent-question tone while an
agent is asking for permission, and the tab strip's amber wash while a
prior turn is unread. A live working turn suppresses the stale unread
tint, mirroring the status-lane rule, and rename mode keeps its flat
input-like surface.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
